{"context": {"ancestors": [], "descendants": [{"account": {"acct": "modnerd@fosstodon.org"}, "card": null, "content": "<p>Great to see quote posts arriving. Has the moderator opt-out been documented yet?</p>", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:35:00.000Z", "favourites_count": 12, "id": "111222333444555701", "in_reply_to_id": "111222333444555666", "reblog": null, "reblogs_count": 0, "replies_count": 1, "spoiler_text": ""}, {"account": {"acct": "joinmastodon"}, "card": null, "content": "<p>Yes, it is in the admin settings under Federation. Per-account and per-instance toggles are both supported.</p>", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:40:00.000Z", "favourites_count": 8, "id": "111222333444555702", "in_reply_to_id": "111222333444555701", "reblog": null, "reblogs_count": 0, "replies_count": 0, "spoiler_text": ""}, {"account": {"acct": "curious_user"}, "card": null, "content": "<p>The improved moderation tooling is what I have been waiting for.</p>", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:50:00.000Z", "favourites_count": 5, "id": "111222333444555703", "in_reply_to_id": "111222333444555666", "reblog": null, "reblogs_count": 0, "replies_count": 0, "spoiler_text": ""}]}, "instance": "mastodon.social", "status": {"account": {"acct": "joinmastodon", "display_name": "Mastodon", "id": "12345", "url": "https://mastodon.social/@joinmastodon", "username": "joinmastodon"}, "card": null, "content": "<p>Mastodon 4.4 is now available. This release focuses on improving the moderation experience and adds support for quote posts. Read the release notes for details.</p>", "created_at": "2025-01-15T09:30:00.000Z", "favourites_count": 247, "id": "111222333444555666", "in_reply_to_account_id": null, "in_reply_to_id": null, "language": "en", "reblog": null, "reblogs_count": 89, "replies_count": 4, "sensitive": false, "spoiler_text": "", "url": "https://mastodon.social/@joinmastodon/111222333444555666"}}
